godotengine/godot/pulls/117606","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117606","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117606.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117606.patch","merged_at":"2026-03-23T21:45:25Z"},"body":"This change simplifies the check for snapping when we're editing the transform of a `Node3D`. It should address godotengine/godot#117497.\r\n\r\n*Bugsquad edit:* Fixes #117497.\r\n\r\nAs of writing, we only update `Node3DEditorViewport::EditData::snap` in `Node3DEditorViewport::begin_transform`. This works well when the user toggles snapping before modifying a `Node3D`'s transform.\r\n\r\nThat said, if the user is pressing and releasing the Ctrl/Cmd key while adjusting a transform, snapping won't necessarily enable/disable.\r\n\r\n~~To address this, we update the state of `snap` in `Node3DEditorViewport::update_transform`. This allows the user to toggle snapping while adjusting a `Node3D`'s transform.~~\r\n\r\nWe now check the snapping state dynamically. See [below](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117606#issuecomment-4094744134).\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\nNo generative AI was used in the research, development, or testing of this PR's changes.","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https